<title>USA: Ultramar says 1996 distribution taxable.</title>
<headline>Ultramar says 1996 distribution taxable.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ultramar Diamond Shamrock Corp officials said on Wednesday the total distribution of $1.10 per share paid to U.S. Ultramar shareholders in 1996 qualifies as a taxable dividend to the recipients.</p>
<p>The measure applies solely to shareholders of record for Ultramar Corp stock prior to the approved merger of Diamond Shamrock Inc and Ultramar Corp into Ultramar Diamond Shamrock Corp on December 3, 1996</p>
<p>This is the first year since Ultramar Corp's initial public offering in 1992 that the entire distribution constitutes a taxable income to recipients.</p>
<p>Ultramar Diamond is an independent refining and marketing company.</p>
</text>
